    fs::write(
        repair_inputs.join("ai_repair_inputs_country_rus.md"),
        "# AI repair inputs\n\n```hoi4skill-input:focus_layout\n修复国策 | id = rus_repaired_focus | x = 0 | y = 0 | 奖励 = 稳定度 +5%\n```\n\n```hoi4skill-input:event_cards\n事件：修复事件\n类型：country_event\n标题：修复事件\n描述：批量修复只写输入模板。\n选项：确认\n效果：add_stability = 0.01\n```\n",
    )
